# This file documents the generated Mosquitto password file.
#
# The real file is infra/mosquitto/passwd, is gitignored, and must be produced by:
#   cp .env.example .env        # edit every password first
#   ./infra/mosquitto/generate-passwd.sh
#
# mosquitto_passwd stores PBKDF2 hashes, not plaintext. Never commit the
# generated file, and never paste real device passwords into this template.
#
# Accounts created by the generator (username: role):
#   backend         : backend subscriber, command publisher
#   simulator       : demo simulator account
#   esp32-<zone_id> : one account per device, for the seven fixed zones
#
# Example of the generated format (values are not usable):
# backend:$7$101$xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx$yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
